        <text_18 sling:resourceType="core/franklin/components/text/v1/text" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" text="&lt;p&gt;Title&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dizziness - symptoms, treatments and causes | healthdirect&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Description&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Being dizzy can make you feel light-headed, unsteady or weak. Read about the causes and symptoms of dizziness, and how to manage symptoms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Image&lt;/p&gt;"/>
